# SteamAPI_Init is deliberately false on Vita, so SteamInternal_ContextInit
# returns this PE's zeroed CSteamAPIContext.  The game normally reads
# ISteamUtils::GetServerRealTime through slot +0xC; when that slot is NULL it
# substitutes Unix second 1.  Ten lines later it subtracts ten hours, and the
# later _mkgmtime64 -> _gmtime64 chain correctly turns that pre-epoch value
# into NULL before an unchecked vector load.  Replace only that unavailable-
# Steam fallback with the Vita RTC's current Unix seconds.  The original PC
# path, including the literal 1, remains outside and before the target guard.
