# are already authenticated by VITA_REFCOUNT_SYNC_IAT_ROOT_SPECS (PE bytes,
# CFG order, direct callers, vtable slots and the exact IAT sites); the seam
# additionally pins every instruction whose effect the native helper replays
# (host_vita_kage_mutex_seam.c) and emits one guarded early return at the top
