# Entity_Effect::Init contains five byte-remap dispatchers across the metadata
# fragments which make up its one real body.  The first live new-run effect is
# variant 0x21 at site 0x1ba2df: after subtracting 0x15 it selects map byte 12,
# table slot zero and the local block at 0x1ba631.  Merging any one fragment
# exposes more of the same body, so pin all five physical sites as one coherent
# package rather than paying one run per newly revealed generic dispatch.
