# The graphics handoff intentionally does not fabricate GLFW's global
# initialized flag.  Its public glfwGetTime root therefore takes the upstream
# GLFW_NOT_INITIALIZED path and returns 0.0 forever, which pins the preserved
# main-loop limiter at 0048bef0 after the first Render return.  Replace this
# high-level API root only while an explicit backend owns the clock; disabled
# execution retains every original instruction.
